  },
  {
    title: "Enterprise contracts",
    body: "Suite licensing, capacity packs, ACV deals, professional services. List price is often not public.",
    expensive:
      "SI implementations, CoE staffing, premium connectors, and multi-year commits before you know if agents work.",
  },
